### oneM2M test requests for the VS Code REST Client (click "Send Request" above each one)
@cse = http://127.0.0.1:8080/cse-mn

### 0) Check the CSEBase
GET {{cse}}
X-M2M-Origin: CAdmin
X-M2M-RI: t0
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 1) List all resources (discovery)
GET {{cse}}?fu=1
X-M2M-Origin: CAdmin
X-M2M-RI: t1
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 2) Add an arrival by hand (step 2), which starts steps 3-7 without the gateway
POST {{cse}}/LineSensor-01/arrivals
X-M2M-Origin: CLineSensor01
X-M2M-RI: t2
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json;ty=4
Accept: application/json

{"m2m:cin": {"con": {"seq": 17, "productId": "A-00017", "ts": "20261104T110500"}}}

### 3) Latest verdict (step 6, flexContainer)
GET {{cse}}/Inspection/inspectionResult
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t3
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 4) Set a verdict by hand (step 6) to test the rejector without the AI
PUT {{cse}}/Inspection/inspectionResult
X-M2M-Origin: CInspection
X-M2M-RI: t4
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"xg:inRet": {"seq": 17, "productId": "A-00017", "verdict": "FAIL", "defectClass": "knife", "confidence": 0.91, "inferenceMs": 38, "modelVer": "yolov8n-xguard-1.0"}}

### 5) Find the defects container by label (step 10)
GET {{cse}}?fu=1&lbl=type:defect&ty=3
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t5
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 6) Defect history (step 10)
GET {{cse}}/Inspection/defects?rcn=4
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t6
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 7) Line status (step 10)
GET {{cse}}/LineSensor-01/lineStatus/la
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t7
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 8) Stop the line through the group fanout
POST {{cse}}/lineA-devices/fopt
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t8
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json;ty=4
Accept: application/json

{"m2m:cin": {"con": {"cmd": "STOP"}}}

### 9) Restart
POST {{cse}}/lineA-devices/fopt
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t9
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json;ty=4
Accept: application/json

{"m2m:cin": {"con": {"cmd": "START"}}}

### 10) Permission check: the dashboard trying to change a verdict should get 4103
PUT {{cse}}/Inspection/inspectionResult
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t10
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"xg:inRet": {"verdict": "PASS"}}
